    "detailed_description": "Enter the secret fort to get the stolen power orb back in this super-tight platformer with (currently) more than 150 challenging, hand-crafted screens.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/eef3c5a5ce222467ca3a30c7436e7614.webp?t=1677857775\" /></div><br><br>This game features a lot of enemies with different abilities such as shooting lasers, guided missiles and division blasts, chasing you, spawning blasts at death or having an energy field.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/1a0369b215961ca23bc41ff168214a20.poster.avif?t=1677857775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/1a0369b215961ca23bc41ff168214a20.webm?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/1a0369b215961ca23bc41ff168214a20.mp4?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/8a121c82647a9ab1f1bfdd296dc9e285.webp?t=1677857775\" /></div><br><br>Found a terrain chunk that does not fit with the ones surrounding it? Shoot it! It may be hidding a key (this game's collectable). Some keys are in a visible, but difficult to reach position.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/05fac5eb79ae0b44922737425fac4d6a.poster.avif?t=1677857775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/05fac5eb79ae0b44922737425fac4d6a.webm?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/05fac5eb79ae0b44922737425fac4d6a.mp4?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/8230b0e8c2aa93a849ee26337e7103d3.webp?t=1677857775\" /></div><br><br>Enjoyable game hazards such as enemy-spawning portals activated by a light trigger, burning falling blocks, moving platforms, conveyor belts, lasers or timed disappearing blocks.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/cc6a6d7a1bce12594ad5b8d29c7f43bd.poster.avif?t=1677857775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/cc6a6d7a1bce12594ad5b8d29c7f43bd.webm?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/cc6a6d7a1bce12594ad5b8d29c7f43bd.mp4?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/b5202452317734fe859ff0649b9053fe.webp?t=1677857775\" /></div><br><br>Fast deaths and lightning-fast respawns will be needed to overcome the difficult challenges this game has to offer.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/179818329bbc1fcddcc40761c103b879.poster.avif?t=1677857775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/179818329bbc1fcddcc40761c103b879.webm?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/179818329bbc1fcddcc40761c103b879.mp4?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/c4341ea738e899d769a3cea45fc8ce7c.webp?t=1677857775\" /></div><br><br>The controls are smooth, precise, simple and easy to remember: dash, shoot, run and jump. Put the character exactly where you want thanks to the precise controls.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/7b7768886f0909f0a87e8eef58fc6840.webp?t=1677857775\" /></div><br><br>Destroy powerful and challenging bosses.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/e4d868d899ca24443099c7be7158911e.avif?t=1677857775\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/cef483fdc35baacf4e501221430dc568.poster.avif?t=1677857775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/cef483fdc35baacf4e501221430dc568.webm?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128730/extras/cef483fdc35baacf4e501221430dc568.mp4?t=1677857775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>",
